#VERSION=2
#
# Gateway registration ACL for the erpl-proto development system.
#
# Phase 8 needs a registered RFC server, and A4H ships without a reginfo, which
# under gw/acl_mode = 1 denies every registration. This permits exactly one
# program ID, only from the docker host and the container itself, and denies
# everything else explicitly so the file does not widen over time.
#
# Install with: docker cp reginfo a4h:/usr/sap/A4H/SYS/global/reginfo
# and set gw/reg_info in DEFAULT.PFL. See docs/spec/13-server.md.
P TP=SAPRFC_TEST HOST=172.17.0.1,172.17.0.2,localhost ACCESS=* CANCEL=172.17.0.1,localhost
#
# Nothing else may register.
D TP=*
